description:
web-to-markdown: Web to Markdown API: reads one public web page from the Cloudflare edge (static HTML, robots.txt respected, no JavaScript) and returns clean markdown or text of the main content with title and links. $0.005 USDC per page (1 cent is this catalog's minimum); refusals cost nothing.
Method: POST
Input: {"url": "string, required", "format": "markdown|text, optional", "links": "boolean, optional", "scope": "main|page, optional"}
